        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I don't have access to Windows machine, so I can not reproduce/debug/fix this. I am afraid the origin of this might be similar to #636, i.e. \"pipe\" not working on Windows.\r\nAt the moment, I am inclined to just document that this 'mini.git' function does not work on Windows and fixing it is welcome. But I'll try to see if I can at least ask somebody to reproduce this.",
